          "kind": "class",
          "description": "Label, help, and error chrome around a slotted control. When `error` is set, help is hidden and the error is shown instead. `required` renders an asterisk beside the label. An `id` on the host is removed and copied onto the first element in the default slot. The field also sets `described-by`, `description`, `invalid`, and `required` on that control. Slotted `label`, `help`, or `error` content replaces the matching property text. No events of its own. No public methods.",
